WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.130
You bastard!

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.390
How dare you put Lady Angelique in danger!

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.870
Hyuuga.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:11.760
There's no other way.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.760
We'll protect Angie.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.450
Please help us.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.150
To me, she's irreplaceable.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.510
I'll protect her whatever the cost.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.350
Dawn has arrived.

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.040
Phase 13: Return, and Then...

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.990
I'll explain the plan.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:28.780
First, we use the Jinx's remote control system to broadcast Angelique's Light of Purification all over Arcadia.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:32.440
I thank you for your courageous decision.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:35.930
If my power can save everyone...

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:38.740
That's why I've come.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:52.010
The Thanatos are known to gather when they sense one of their own in danger.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:56.190
This plan relies on that fact.

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:03.580
In other words, every Thanatos in Arcadia will track down threats to their species and they'll all come here, Angelique.

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:08.730
This plan is to take them all out when they arrive.

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:12.070
Is that even possible?

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.110
Theoretically.

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:21.470
Angie's Light of Purification and the Jinx control system are broadcast on a similar frequency.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:27.490
It'll take some tinkering, but it's possible to harmonize them.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:34.930
Yorgo has been preparing for this day; he's rebuilt all the existing facilities.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:38.070
We'll stop the Thanatos here.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.930
Yeah, but...

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:44.790
During that period, Angie must maintain her Light of Purification.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:48.130
It's a question of whether she has the stamina to see it through.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:52.400
It will drain her using her power against such a large number of Thanatos.

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:56.350
So, it's a race against time?

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.440
We'll protect her!

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.650
We're ready.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:17.970
Roger.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.110
Everyone's in position.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:30.720
Begin the operation.

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:03.310
This is...

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:04.770
Okay!

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.330
I knew it!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.730
The Light of Purification!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:17.600
Just like the Foundation said!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.490
This is their plan?

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.600
Hyuuga, protect the Queen's Egg.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:41.340
They're here?

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:45.010
Angie.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.830
I'll protect you!

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:56.370
We cannot lose our light!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:05.740
Angie's Light of Purification is weakening the Thanatos.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.290
But...

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:10.070
Be safe, Angie!

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.080
One hour and twenty-three minutes have passed.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:21.050
Thanatos materialization rate has dropped by fifteen percent!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.760
I want to protect them.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.170
I want to protect the world...

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:42.760
and the people I care about.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:46.340
Right now...

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.300
We're fighting together.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:54.810
We are one.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.340
We're together, Angie!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:09.890
More showed up?

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.030
They're getting weaker, though.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.360
Three hours and twenty-three minutes since the start of the operation.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:17.810
No change in the intensity of the Light of Purification.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.710
If she has to use her power any more, Angie will be in danger.

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.080
We must defeat them!

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:41.520
What?

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:42.480
This is...

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.910
The Queen's Egg's level of consciousness is dropping!

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:54.120
The Light of Purification's intensity has dropped by twenty percent!

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.130
Lein, haven't you finished yet?

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:33.530
I've finally returned to the Sunlit Mansion...

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:39.500
Everyone?

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:40.860
Where are you?

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:41.950
Lein?

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.130
Nyx!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.300
Jade!

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.740
Hyuuga!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:51.570
Take this!

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:22.650
No!

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.350
Is this the end?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:52.990
Everyone...

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:57.540
Wait!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.290
I want to save everyone.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:07.400
I want to save everyone... all the people I care about.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.750
A warm glow.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.500
That angelic form...

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.070
I don't believe it.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.910
Lady Angelique...

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:47.300
Let's go!

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.770
I want to protect...

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:27.340
There are those I want to protect with all my strength.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.490
You are...

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:04.500
I've finally returned to the Sunlit Mansion...

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.160
I'm home!

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:18.750
Please sit, Mademoiselle.

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:22.580
It's not much, but it's a celebration of today's victory.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:24.260
Thank you very much!

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:26.110
What a feast!

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:28.820
Nyx cooked everything today.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:33.970
I decided to make use of my victory at cards.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.990
That was when we'd all just arrived at the Sunlit Mansion.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:46.520
That day, we all cooked together like you said, Angie.

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.760
I wouldn't call that "together."

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.740
It was a disaster.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.500
That brings back memories.

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.820
What's wrong, Angie?

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:03.600
Now we can all live together in the Sunlit Mansion!

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.520
The Thanatos threat has receded for now.

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:10.570
It's all thanks to you, Lady Angelique.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.800
No, it's all because of you.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:16.870
I couldn't have done it alone.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:21.380
I'm so happy! Now, all the smiles will return to the people of Arcadia!

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.510
Right!

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:26.050
This isn't the end.

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:29.850
Erbos controls the Thanatos.

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:34.210
Unless you defeat Erbos, the fundamental problem still remains.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.510
Indeed.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:39.490
The Thanatos may reappear at any moment.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:40.670
Yes.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:44.320
Nyx is right. It's not over yet.

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:52.670
Erbos is merely sending his shadows through a rift in time and space to Arcadia.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:58.630
Only one person can defeat Erbos: the Queen herself.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.150
That's right.

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:07.120
So, we need you to become the true Queen as soon as possible.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:13.100
I still don't know how to become the Queen.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:19.620
But, by purifying all Thanatos in my path, I'm sure I'll find a way.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:23.270
Yes, I think so too.

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:25.730
Erwin?

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:32.680
You want some more?

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:36.610
Someday, she'll become the Queen.

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:39.490
I'm sure you'll be gentle yet strong...

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.230
A wonderful Queen.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:44.570
Worthy of ruling the world.

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.500
Lady Angelique?

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:54.120
Hyuuga, what's wrong?

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:56.990
I'll say this once more.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.510
Until the day you become Queen, I shall protect you even if it costs me my life.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:05.320
As a Knight, I swear my loyalty to you from the depths of my heart.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.370
Loyalty?

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:08.870
If you put it like that...

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:16.630
That means you'll do everything I say, right?

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:19.540
The Queen's orders are absolute.

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:21.760
Then I have one request.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:22.760
Yes.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.840
The word "Queen" is forbidden.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:31.480
So is "Lady Angelique" and all formal speech; it's all forbidden.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.280
Well...

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:36.140
We're companions.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.280
I want you to speak to me normally.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.130
Practice, Hyuuga.

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:45.730
The Queen's orders are absolute.

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:48.280
Hurry up.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.740
Angelique...

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.690
I can't hear you.

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:55.740
Ange... Angelique!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:56.830
That's it!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:57.800
He said it!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:59.160
Amazing!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:02.800
You can do it if you try, can't you?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.790
Nyx?

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:05.730
I'll make some tea.

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:12.490
Father... mother...

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:16.150
I've finally found a home.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:19.740
The Sunlit Mansion is my home, isn't it?

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:35.670
She used so much of her Light of Purification.

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:37.210
She must be exhausted.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:40.590
I'd like to let her rest at the Sunlit Mansion for a while.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.100
Even angels need their rest.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:49.010
Why does a kind young girl like her carry the burden of such a cruel destiny?

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.820
Come to think of it, Nyx is taking his time.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:57.810
I'm sure he's just preparing his finest tea for us.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.560
I'll go help him...

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.140
Smoke.

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.280
Angie!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.980
It's a fire, Angie!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.370
Where's Nyx?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.580
I'll go find him!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:18.830
Lein!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.200
Nyx!

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.480
Nyx...

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:25.850
Nyx!

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:27.390
Lein.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:28.600
Nyx is gone.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:31.140
Damn! There's nothing we can do.

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:32.240
We have to get out of here now!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:32.950
Yeah.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:33.800
The fire...

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.270
We need to put out the fire.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.680
We need to get out of here first.

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:37.510
Let's go.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:38.510
Come on.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.450
This is...

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.270
How horrible.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.220
No, even this place...

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:53.430
No!

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.280
What are you doing?

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.260
The fire... we need to put out the fire!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.710
The Sunlit Mansion will burn down!

00:17:58.780 --> 00:17:59.920
It's too late!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.840
The fire is spreading too fast!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.700
But... the Sunlit Mansion will burn down!

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.560
The fire... we need to put out the fire!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.430
Run!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:08.500
No!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:14.390
Lein, take Angelique and get out of here!

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:19.360
The smoke may have caused Nyx to collapse somewhere in the mansion.

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:21.040
We'll find him!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:21.980
Thanks!

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:22.820
Good luck!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:28.380
Queen's Egg.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.690
Nyx?

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:39.760
What are you doing?

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:43.040
Turn to ash with this mansion!

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:44.610
No...

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.430
Stop!

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:53.580
Angie!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.180
The Sunlit Mansion...

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:06.970
Why are you doing this?

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.610
Nyx!

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:14.330
Nyx!

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:19.050
Thanatos?

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:22.270
Is this Nyx's doing too?

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:24.550
Get Angelique out of here!

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:27.780
We can't get out the front way!

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:29.770
Everyone, head around to the back!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.250
No...

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:46.760
How horrible.

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.320
Let's bust our way out!

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.800
We'll escape to the mountain behind the mansion!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:54.780
Got it!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.540
There's no end to them!

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:17.800
It's burning.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.190
The Sunlit Mansion is burning...

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:25.750
Angie!

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:31.980
The Sunlit Mansion is gone.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.840
Jade, what are you doing?

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.000
Yeah.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:41.680
Angie... it's okay.

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.640
We'll protect you.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.480
At this rate, we'll...

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:07.630
A dead end?

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:14.760
No matter what happens, we'll protect Angie.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:15.780
Yes!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.370
Even if it costs us our lives.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:22.350
Thanatos...

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:39.890
Why?

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:59.380
Angelique...

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:40.710
With the disappearance of the Queen's Egg, the world was enveloped in darkness.

00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:42.330
Angelique...

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:44.780
Where are you now?

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:46.470
Neo Angelique Abyss,

00:23:45.160 --> 00:23:49.910
Act 01: Lost Light

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:47.790
Second Age.

00:23:48.050 --> 00:23:49.550
Starts next episode.
